************************************************************
* NEW STANFORD PASCAL - PASCAL EXEC ************************
************************************************************
&IF .&1 EQ . &GOTO -SYNTAX
&IF .&2 EQ . &GOTO -OK1
&IF &2 EQ ( &GOTO -OK0
&GOTO -SYNTAX
-OK0
&IF .&3 EQ .NOLINK &GOTO -OK1
&GOTO -SYNTAX
-SYNTAX
&BEGTYPE
This is the New Stanford Pascal compiler
The PASCAL EXEC is used to compile Pascal programs
Usage:
PASCAL sourcename           -- for main programs
PASCAL sourcename (NOLINK   -- for modules (subprograms)
&END
&EXIT 20
-OK1
STATE &1 PASCAL A
&IF &RETCODE EQ 0 &GOTO -OK2
&BEGTYPE
Source file &1 PASCAL A cannot be found
&END
&EXIT 12
-OK2
EXEC PASCOMP &1
&IF &RETCODE > 0 &GOTO -ERROR
EXEC PASC370 &1
&IF &RETCODE > 0 &GOTO -ERROR
&IF .&3 EQ .NOLINK &EXIT 0
EXEC PASLINK &1
&EXIT &RETCODE
-ERROR
&EXIT &RETCODE
